==Description==
The '''Mirror Nametag''' is an {{Color|Uncommon}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|1,000}}.

The '''Mirror Nametag''' has text with white to grey gradient and a black outline.

==Trivia==
*The description of the '''Mirror Nametag''' misspells ''reflection'' as ''relection''.

